        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\{(1,1),(2,1),(4,1),(4,3)\\}$",
          "worked": "For $a=1$, $b=1$.\n\nFor $a=2$, $b=1$.\n\nFor $a=4$, $b=1,3$.\n\nThe ordered pairs are $\\{(1,1),(2,1),(4,1),(4,3)\\}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 21
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$b=2a-1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\{(1,1),(2,3)\\}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}a&=1:& b&=2(1)-1=1\\\\a&=2:& b&=2(2)-1=3\\\\a&=4:& b&=2(4)-1=7\\end{aligned}$\n\nSince $7\\notin B$, the ordered pairs are $\\{(1,1),(2,3)\\}$.",
